#: ../../source/notebooks/18. Dynamic Selection.ipynb:9 Symbol
#: c359f0501b9b4dc2a20a05cc15d88afd
msgid "Dynamic Symbol Selection"
msgstr "动态品种选择"

#: ../../source/notebooks/18. 32d66af1b8c149ba8498923c230b995b Dynamic
#: Selection.ipynb:11 Symbol
msgid ""
"Every strategy we've seen has traded a fixed list of ticker symbols that "
"were chosen beforehand. Alternatively, we may want a strategy to target "
"whichever symbols look best at any given time. These could be the most "
"liquid names, or the ones with the highest momentum or value."
msgstr "到目前为止，每个策略交易的都是在回测开始前就已选定的固定股票代码列表。而我们有时希望策略能够瞄准当下表现最好的品种，例如流动性最高的品种，或者动量或价值最高的品种。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/18. Dynamic Selection.ipynb:13 Symbol
#: c8b7c8f3e4a14d7ea745243ab2de317a
msgid ""
"**PyBroker v2** now enables dynamic symbol selection with `SymbolSelector"
" "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.SymbolSelector>`__."
msgstr ""
"**PyBroker v2** 现已通过 `SymbolSelector "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.SymbolSelector>`__"
" 支持动态品种选择。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/18. 3c4c353af8ff48f48aab77ae77a802a1 Dynamic
#: Selection.ipynb:25 Symbol
msgid "Loading the Candidate Universe"
msgstr "加载候选品种池"

#: ../../source/notebooks/18. Dynamic Selection.ipynb:27 Symbol
#: e3d9e358f8be4d3c9f5dc9a8dae183cb
msgid ""
"Below, data is downloaded for twenty liquid large-caps from `YFinance "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.YFinance>`__:"
msgstr ""
"下面将从 `YFinance "
